Khelo Tech modifications
------------------------
This fork is maintained internally by Khelo Tech for company use. Notable
areas of change relative to upstream Plane Community Edition include:

- Product rebrand (name, colours, logos, email templates)
- Internal deployment tooling and Bitbucket Pipelines CI
- Bitbucket Cloud read-only commit ingest and identity linking
- Custom fields on work items
- Time tracking and timesheets
- Work item and project templates
- Workflow automation and approval gates
- Extended analytics and dashboards
- Intake triage defaults and cycle auto-rollover

Git remotes (intended)
----------------------
origin   – Khelo Tech Bitbucket repository (fetch + push)
upstream – https://github.com/makeplane/plane.git (fetch only)

